 "mapName": "Indiana Statewide 3DEP Lidar Dates",
 "description": "<p>This map shows Indiana\u2019s Statewide 3DEP lidar dates\npublished from detailed GPSTime information that was derived from the lidar\nPoint Cloud data.<span>  <\/span>Click any location on\nthe map to see the collection date for that point.<span>  <\/span>Clicking on the statewide map view shows the\nlidar collection year for each county (the oldest collection year is shown).<span>  <\/span>Zoom in on the map to display detailed\ncollection areas by individual collection dates (there are 68 different\ncollection dates statewide).<span>  <\/span>Finally\nzoom in more to see the individual lidar tile grid (there are 41,648 total ties),\nand click on any tile to see its collection date.<span>  <\/span>Enter a county name in the search box to zoom\ndirectly to it.<\/p>",
